reviews.text:
They told me to sit down, but since it looked like a group was coming in, I told them to go back out and wait. This is a business person, so I understand if you feel bad.

While waiting, I took a seat for two, and when I ordered squid and makgeolli, the male owner came over and told me that he couldn't do it if he was going to order something so simple. I said he would order more while I was eating, but he kept muttering to himself;

The price of all snacks is 18,000-22,000.
The squid was 18,000 won and it wasn't cheap and it wasn't a side. He came and said that, so I asked if I ordered the squid on its own even though it wasn't a side and it wasn't cheap.

They said that it was a good thing because their store was busy right now, and that they were sorry and that they should go to another store, but they only said what they had to say and took all the water, saying to the kitchen, “Cancel the squid!” I came out laughing dumbfounded.

This is my first time seeing a store like this in my life. This is my first time writing something like this;;;;;
There is a restaurant like the controversial Yeosu Restaurant in Jongno;
No matter how good the money is, don't be picky when it comes to customers.

It's shocking. It really ruins my mood.
